		<label>Norinco MAK-91</label>
		<description>Caliber: 7.62x39mm. 10-round detachable mag. Semi-Automatic.
		
Literally meaning the "Model of AK"-91, the Norinco MAK-91 is one name for the semi-automatic locked civilian Type 56 rifles (in an LMG-esque configuration) exported by the North China Industries Corporation (Norinco.) In order to comply with restrictions and regulations on imported firearms, many of the MAK-91s were modified before or after importation - this model has been fitted with a thumbhole stock, for sale in a locale where pistol grips were banned on semi-automatic rifles.</description>
